cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this result, please cite the write-up."
title: "rc2-pi-tables: RC2's PITABLE and version table rebuilt from the digits of pi"
version: "1.1"
abstract: "Both permutations in RFC 2268 (PITABLE and the RC2Version table) are reproduced exactly by a Fisher-Yates shuffle driven by the decimal digits of pi, reading three digits per draw with rejection sampling."
authors:
  - family-names: Hamadeh
    given-names: Khalid
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: MIT
